<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρεβος</span></b> , τό : 
			Att.
		 gen. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρέβους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					694
				</span></i>
			, 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρέβευς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.368
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.37
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρέβεσφιν</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρέβευσφιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				669
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				349
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ Ἐρεβ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.572
				</span></i>
			 : no dat. or pl. occurs:—<i>Erebos,</i> a place
			of nether darkness, forming a passage from Earth to Hades, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.327
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.528
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				515
			</span></i>, etc. ; rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				371e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.953a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1130d
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ὕφαλον</span>
			<i>the darkness</i> of the deep, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				589
			</span></i>(lyr.) ; of a riddle, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξυνέτοις ἔ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.429
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			personified, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				125
			</span></i>. (Skt. <i>rájas,</i> Goth. <i>riqis,</i>
			ONorse <i>røkkr</i> 'darkness'.)</div>
